&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About THG Ingenuity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THG Ingenuity is a proprietary Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) technology, robotics, and operations platform built for global ecommerce. Developed through more than two decades of operating ecommerce and retail services at scale, its software and automation capabilities have been engineered, tested, and refined through the real-world demands of managing complex commerce operations. Today, THG Ingenuity provides an integrating operating environment that enables brands to intelligently optimise the entire commerce lifecycle from browsing and checkout to AI inventory management and forecasting, automated fulfilment, carrier control, and customer experience. The platform comprises:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THG Fulfil: The fulfilment operating system for global ecommerce. Delivered via a proprietary SaaS and Robotics-as-a-Service (RaaS) model, THG Fulfil orchestrates every stage of checkout, fulfilment, delivery, and customer experience through an integrated system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THG Studios: The UK&#39;s most innovative creative hub, helping brands create content that connects, experiences that engage, and IP that scales, all from its end-to-end, in-house facilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THG Commerce: A cloud-native technology stack enabling retailers and brands to create intelligent, AI-powered, digital shopping experiences, while integrated marketplace and social commerce functionality allows brands to reach customers across every sales channel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With its expertise in building and scaling brands, THG Ingenuity is uniquely positioned to bring pertinent, pragmatic, and global know-how across all aspects of commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a talented and commercially astute Data Scientist to join our dynamic team tackling Fraud, Payments and Finance. In this multi-focus role, you will be responsible for protecting our global e-commerce operations from fraud, optimising our payments performance and driving profitability and automation initiatives within Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working with vast, complex datasets, the work will involve combatting online fraud using our award-winning THG Detect platform and driving payments optimisation by increasing authorisation rates, while also using the latest AI software and Google Cloud Platform (GCP) infrastructure to build complex data solutions and applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a blend of strong technical skills, commercial acumen, and effective communication to translate complex data insights into tangible business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimise Fraud Detection:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Continuously improve automated decision-making in our in-house THG Detect platform using machine learning and decision rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enhance Payment Performance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lead data-driven initiatives to boost payment authorisation rates, optimise transaction routing, and reduce costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Profitability within Finance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lead automation and profitability initiatives across different areas of Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate Performance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Report on all aspects of fraud, payments and finance performance to stakeholders at all levels, including C-level management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive System Improvements:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collaborate with Fraud, Payments, Finance and Engineering teams to scope and implement enhancements to detection systems and data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate &amp;amp; Automate:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proactively identify opportunities to improve detection capabilities, drive profitability, increase payment success, and enhance team efficiency through automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with SQL &amp;amp; Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in a data visualisation software (Tableau/Looker/PowerBI/e.t.c.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using a variety of machine learning algorithms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to communicate effectively; using data to tell a story and drive business change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within Google Cloud preferential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG Ingenuity is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG Ingenuity is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG Ingenuity please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;Growth at HRtechX&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The world’s most demanding investors are busy managing trillions, and ignore anything average. Are you excited by the challenge of making them act?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you looking to work in an exceptional entrepreneurial team with ambitious, motivated and extremely driven people? And do you want real ownership from your first week? If so, now is the time to apply for the Growth role at Private Equity Insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The mission: build the world&#39;s largest network for private equity investors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work in sprints and get fast execution under your skin. AI has completely changed the game: You will learn to deploy it to outperform a marketing team of 20+ people, while also learning the fundamentals of copywriting that makes elite investors act, get it to the right investor at a meaningful frequency and deploy what works across every marketing channel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want an ambitious mission, real ownership and the fastest learning curve of your career: apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why HRtechX&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HRtechX is a world leading HRtech community, connecting industry executives, entrepreneurs and professionals. We are a start-up on a growth journey who help leaders evolve and create stronger businesses through people and technology. We aim to address the challenges and opportunities for HR and HR Tech. We bring together the most influential executives, investors, and entrepreneurs to share their insights on how technology will shape the future of HR, as well as forge long lasting partnerships and client relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HRtechX is part of United Media (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.united-media.com/&quot;&gt;https://www.united-media.com/&lt;/a&gt;) which focuses on building large scale industry media and conferences products in sectors such as insurance, HR, private equity, retail, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master the highest bar in the world.&lt;/strong&gt; Our audience is the world&#39;s most demanding investors. They ignore anything average. If your work can make them act, you can make anyone act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unlimited growth potential. &lt;/strong&gt;You will get responsibility before you feel ready. That is how you grow fast. We strongly believe in and have a track record of promoting internally. You can expect coaching and development from leaders, peers and experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills that compound for life.&lt;/strong&gt; Fast execution, copywriting, pricing, conversion optimisation, structured problem solving, and the ability to create impact anywhere in the business at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership from the very start.&lt;/strong&gt; You own outcomes, not tasks. We agree the goal, and you find the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel opportunity.&lt;/strong&gt; You will be joining our 10+ conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities in this job will vary, however, feed into the mission: build the world&#39;s largest network for private equity investors. They will be mostly centered around the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the audience.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, target, and convert every fund into our community, and make sure each one receives the right message, at the right time, and never one too many.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own marketing channels that drive revenue. &lt;/strong&gt;Through existing and new marketing channels, you execute activities that ultimately will drive revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Write copy that persuades.&lt;/strong&gt; Every email, landing page and post. Become the best copywriter and leverage it at scale with AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sprint, test, implement.&lt;/strong&gt; Measure the impact of all experiments you run, test offers, copy, prices and pages until the numbers move.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build systems, not one-offs.&lt;/strong&gt; Anything you do twice becomes a playbook or an AI workflow, so the next win takes less effort than the last.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do whatever it takes to win.&lt;/strong&gt; Some days that means designing an AI workflow. Some days it means checking investors in at the registration desk at 7am. Nobody here is too good for the work that deliver value for investors and fund managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we expect from you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 to 3 years of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Min. a bachelor or master degree with great results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A UK work permit. We do not sponsor visas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong work ethic with a sense of urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional drive and desire to be the best at what you do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive approach and sense of ownership/responsibility of everything you do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A humble approach and share our passion for building companies and developing people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in continuous learning and proactively searching for ways to optimise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full-time, in person from our London office (WeWork), 5 days a week. Expect to travel for work about 20 days a year. The start date is flexible.&lt;/p&gt;
<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

